<spell-notebook "flyout theming">
	<header level="1">
		Flyout
		<header>A flyout is a modal that slides in from a side of the page.</>
	</>
	<flyout-tab-bar showing="theming"/>
	<section>
		<menu class="ui-docs-section-tabs" appearance="segmented" aria-label="Sections">
			<item link="#tokens">Tokens</>
			<item link="#themes">Themes</>
		</>
	</>

	<!-- THEMING:  the family's tokens, live, plus how to set them and which themes touch it. -->
	<section label="Tokens">
		<markdown>
			Theme with the public `--ui-flyout-*` tokens: set one on the element, on any ancestor (`:root` for every
			flyout), or on the box through `::part(flyout)`. They inherit into the shadow root, where the sheet reads each
			through a private alias, so nothing inside blocks them.

			- The `width` words and columns replace `--ui-flyout-width`; `inverted` replaces the background, the header
			  colour and the actions background.
			- Slotted parts read `--ui-flyout-header-color` and `--ui-flyout-actions-background` from the flyout, so set
			  those on the flyout or above it, not on the part.
			- `--ui-flyout-dimmer-background` colours the backdrop; `blurring` reads the shared dimmer tokens.
			- The shorthands are parts: `header`, `content`, and `close` for the close icon.
		</>
		<markdown>
			```css
			/* every flyout on the page */
			ui-flyout {
			  --ui-flyout-width: 480px;
			  --ui-flyout-dimmer-background: oklch(0 0 0 / 0.25);
			}
			/* the close icon */
			ui-flyout::part(close) {
			  opacity: 1;
			}
			```
		</>
		<message state="info" size="small">
			<markdown>Never set the `--_ui-flyout-*` names: they're the sheet's private plumbing.</>
		</>
		<markdown>Edit a value below to try it.</>
		<html>
			<ui-docs-tokens family="ui-flyout" playground>
				<button type="button" class="ui button" commandfor="flyout-types-standard-playground" command="--show">Show</>
				<ui-flyout id="flyout-types-standard-playground" closable>
					<ui-header>Archive old messages</>
					<ui-content>
						<ui-text paragraph>Your inbox is getting full. Would you like us to enable automatic archiving of old messages?</>
					</>
					<ui-actions>
						<ui-button class="cancel" color="red">No</>
						<ui-button class="ok" color="green">Yes</>
					</>
				</>
			</>
		</>
	</>

	<section label="Themes">
		<markdown>
			The theme menu above picks the theme for every page of the site:  Spell, Glass, Fruity or Merlot,
			each restyling this component through its tokens.
		</>
	</>
</spell-notebook>
